  "note": "Doctor Strange and Black Panther overlap messily with the films either side of them. Most people watch the Infinity Saga in release order first and save the chronological run for a rewatch. After Endgame the films broadly follow release order: Black Widow is the only later film set earlier, just after Civil War, and The Fantastic Four: First Steps takes place in another universe entirely."
